WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
narrator: The SSH fixture starts three stock Tailscale peers.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
narrator: Traffic uses the local mesh; paid exit service is outside this test.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:12.000
narrator: Inspect peer one's roster and peer two's tailnet address.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:33.000
narrator: Dropbear and a temporary SSH key prepare the target.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:57.000
narrator: Copy the public key to peer two's authorized keys.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:13.000
narrator: Read peer two's address for this fixture connection.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:25.000
narrator: SSH uses tailscale nc as its proxy; check for session_ok.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:36.000
narrator: Teardown removes the fixture containers.
